# title: Miner that comes home
# description: Digs a tunnel forward until its storage is full or its power is low, then walks back to where it started, empties out and stops. Made for a robot that starts on a charger.
# Setup: put the robot on a charger (the charger charges the robot on top of it), facing
# the rock to dig, with a chest behind it. Give it a Hover Upgrade if the way back is
# not on the floor. Everything it digs goes into its storage.
use waypoint

# --- settings ---
set low_power = 30
set longest = 200

call waypoint.save "home"
set dug = 0

# dig on while there is a free slot, power and tunnel left to dig
loop fits and battery_level > low_power and dug < longest
  dig front
  move forward
  if not ok
    break
  add dug 1

# back along the tunnel, to the spot and the facing it started with
call waypoint.go_face "home"

# the chest behind: everything out, then stay and charge
turn around
put
turn around
chat "Back home, tunnel length " + dug
